            "review_title": "Review at Banh Xeo Em Oi!",
            "review_text": "Lauren E\nLondon, United Kingdom42 contributions\n0\nGreat vegan mushroom Banh Xeo\nDec 2019 • Couples\nThe vegan mushroom Banh Xeo here is AMAZING, it tastes so good! We ordered it between two people with veggie spring rolls (also really great) and it was plenty of food for us to share. I’d definitely recommend this as a good vegetarian/vegan option within the street food market.\nWritten December 12, 2019",
