            "review_title": "Review at Banh Xeo Em Oi!",
            "review_text": "David D\nAdelaide, Australia889 contributions\n3\nVery good value but prawns and dipping sauce below average\nNov 2019 • Solo\nI’ve been looking for good Banh Xeo and a local friend had recommended one in district 3. Unfortunately I was a long way from there so decided to try Banh Xeo Em Oi. While others have rated it highly I think the pancake is not one of the best I’ve had. The prawns were chewy and lacked flavour. The pork was also average. Finally the dipping sauce was a real let down lacking any zing and flavour. The redeeming feature was the pancake itself. I guess it’s not bad for the price but next time I’ll go that further distance to District 3\nRead more\nWritten November 27, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
