            "review_title": "Review at Banh Xeo Em Oi!",
            "review_text": "ValentyD\nToronto, Canada263 contributions\n0\nGreat food!\nApr 2019 • Family\nGreat value and nice meal. Pretty consistent every time we order. Pretty filling, interesting concept. Never heard about this dish, so it was cool to give it a try. Don't forget to use fish sauce for an extra flavour.\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 13, 2019\nVy Truong\nYes, you're right. Fish sauce is such an essential part for not only Banh Xeo but for a lot of Vietnamese dishes at our stall. We're glad you enjoyed the time and the food. Thanks so much!\nRead more\nWritten May 9, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
